  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For continuity at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi